# ── Google Drive API key (audio streaming) ─────────────────────────────────
# SoftyFy streams every song through the Drive API (`alt=media`). A single
# API key is used for every stream URL — key rotation was removed (personal
# library usage is far below one key's per-day download quota, and rotation
# made retry/failure behavior harder to reason about).
#
# Usage:
#   - Scripts that rewrite songs.ts read SOFTYFY_DRIVE_API_KEY first. Load it
#     with:
#         node --env-file=.env scripts/link-drive-songs.mjs
#   - The Vite build never reads API keys — they are baked into songs.ts and
#     ship to the browser as public, key-restricted keys.
#
# All values are optional: with no env key set, a built-in default key is used.
# Retired keys from the old rotation setup, kept as a manual fallback if the
# daily download quota is ever hit (no live rotation code uses them):
#   AIzaSyDJQOBTOSYvirZGDLjDOSEssJHx5e_BXDk
#   AIzaSyD0q-Vxl3jNY1VOjJ6Z2AkWvMwL2QW4oIo

SOFTYFY_DRIVE_API_KEY=